msgstr "Birincil Aygıt ya da Bağlantı Aygıt Kurulsun mu?"

#: data/resources/ui/setup_window.blp:88 data/resources/ui/setup_window.blp:320
#: data/resources/ui/setup_window.blp:327
msgid "Primary Device"
